5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. I believe we should focus on sharing verified facts as soon as they emerge to eliminate the threat efficiently.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Jonathan. Logic and transparency are our best tools. Let's observe who hesitates to provide information.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi! I'm ready! What should we do? Should we just guess or wait for the Seer to tell us something?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's be cautious. Rushing into accusations without evidence might only help the werewolf. Observation is key for now.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A balanced approach is best. While transparency is lovely, a bit of discretion prevents the werewolf from knowing exactly who to target.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Discretion has its place, but if the Seer finds a werewolf, delaying that information only risks more lives.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. While I appreciate Misaki's caution, being too passive allows the enemy to manipulate the narrative. We need a clear lead.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Oh, that makes sense! If the Seer knows something, they should tell us fast so we can catch the bad guy!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"I didn't say we should be passive, just that we should analyze the patterns of speech. Inconsistencies are more telling than silence.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Misaki. However, let us not forget that a clever wolf can mimic consistency perfectly. Let's keep our minds open.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. We should look for contradictions. If someone's story changes, that is a verified fact we can act upon.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Precisely. I'll be keeping a close eye on everyone's logic. If anyone's reasoning fails to hold up, I'll be the first to point it out.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,I'll help too! I'm really good at noticing when things feel weird. I'll watch everyone very closely!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,That's a good plan. Let's see how everyone reacts once the first night's information is available.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,It seems we have a consensus on the methodology. I look forward to seeing how our collective intuition fares against the wolf.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we are ready. Let us hope for a peaceful night and a clear revelation tomorrow.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's hope for clarity. I'm confident we can identify the enemy if we stay focused and logical.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Rin,,I hope the Seer finds the werewolf tonight! That would be so cool! Good luck everyone!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
